 "cita": {
  "cita": "I am proud of the results the Vistra team delivered this quarter",
  "quien": "Jim Burke, president and CEO of Vistra",
  "cita_es": "Estoy orgulloso de los resultados que el equipo de Vistra ha logrado este trimestre"
 },
 "destacados": {
  "titulo": "Earnings Release Highlights",
  "texto": [
   "GAAP third quarter 2026 Net Income of $1,140 million, including an unrealized gain from hedges expected to settle in future years of $559 million.",
   "Achieved more than 50% growth in Ongoing Operations Adjusted EBITDA 1 to $2,378 million for the quarter compared to third quarter 2025.",
   "Raised the midpoint and narrowed the range for 2026 Ongoing Operations Adjusted EBITDA 1 to $7.1 billion to $7.5 billion and Ongoing Operations Adjusted FCFbG 1 to $4.3 billion to $4.7 billion.",
   "Initiated 2027 Ongoing Operations Adjusted EBITDA 1 and Ongoing Operations Adjusted FCFbG 1 guidance ranges of $7.7 billion to $8.5 billion and $4.3 billion to $5.1 billion, respectively.",
   "Board authorized an additional $1.5 billion of share repurchases, which is expected to be utilized by year-end 2028.",
   "In October 2026, closed the acquisition of Cogentrix Energy, consisting of approximately 5,500 MW of natural gas-fueled generation capacity.",
   "Commenced operations of our 405 MW Pulaski Solar Facility in Illinois, under a power purchase agreement with Microsoft, and our 100 MW Deer Creek Solar & Energy Storage Facility in California.",
   "Announced a 20-year 207 MW power purchase agreement with New Era Energy and Digital at our Odessa combined cycle gas plant in Texas."
  ],
  "texto_es": [
   "Beneficio neto GAAP del 3T26 de 1.140 M$, que incluye una ganancia no realizada de 559 M$ por coberturas que se liquidarán en años futuros.",
   "Crecimiento de más del 50% del EBITDA ajustado de operaciones continuadas (1), hasta 2.378 M$ en el trimestre, frente al 3T25.",
   "Elevado el punto medio y estrechado el rango de 2026 del EBITDA ajustado de operaciones continuadas (1) a 7.100–7.500 M$ y del FCF ajustado antes de crecimiento (1) a 4.300–4.700 M$.",
   "Iniciada la guía de 2027 del EBITDA ajustado de operaciones continuadas (1) y del FCF ajustado antes de crecimiento (1): 7.700–8.500 M$ y 4.300–5.100 M$, respectivamente.",
   "El consejo ha autorizado 1.500 M$ adicionales de recompra de acciones, que se prevé utilizar antes del final de 2028.",
   "En octubre de 2026 se cerró la compra de Cogentrix Energy, con unos 5.500 MW de capacidad de generación con gas natural.",
   "Entrada en operación de la planta solar Pulaski, de 405 MW, en Illinois, con un contrato de compra de energía con Microsoft, y de la planta solar y de almacenamiento Deer Creek, de 100 MW, en California.",
